      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_TUTO_03_NOA_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "BgFlashBang": 0.3,
      "BgCrash": 0.3,
      "BgCrashTime": 0.3,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SPEAR",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "EmotionEffect": "UPSET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "시끄러워요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "<r=うるさ>五月蠅</r>いです！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 33,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_TUTO_03_NOA_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SPEAR",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "오늘 일은 다 끝냈나요? ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "今日の仕事は全部終わりましたか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 34,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_TUTO_03_NOA_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SPEAR",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "분명 오전 내로 로비 청소를 마치기로 했을 텐데요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "たしか午前中にロビー掃除を終えるって約束では？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 35,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_TUTO_03_NOA_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
